<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  [DISABLED 2026-09-24 — retired. The dev server has been down since 2026-09-24;
  the production UI on port 3002 has been up throughout, so nothing was lost.
  Nothing depends on 5173: the justfile explicitly handles its absence, and the
  backend merely allows that origin in CORS. It crash-loops on an esbuild
  dep-optimiser target error that was not worth fixing for a dev-only surface.
  The plist and the ui directory are kept deliberately, so that re-enabling is a
  bootstrap away. Re-enable only if you want the Vite dev dashboard on 5173 back,
  and expect to fix the esbuild target first.

  STATE as of 2026-10-08: still bootstrapped in launchd and still crash-looping
  (runs = 534, last exit code = 1, KeepAlive true). Retirement is decided but not
  yet enacted; the bootout is a separate, deliberate step.

  NOTE: check_scheduler_health.py cannot read this comment. It takes its launchd
  roster from every *.plist in scripts/launchd/ and has no retired-plist
  mechanism, so it reports this agent on whatever launchctl says. While it is
  loaded and up it reads OK despite the crash loop (runs is nonzero and state is
  running, so the nonzero exit is treated as a KeepAlive restart); once it is
  booted out it will read FAIL as "not loaded in launchd (plist is in the repo
  but not installed)". See the commit message for what a mechanism would need.]

  com.tomloughran.openstory.ui — OpenStory Vite dashboard (http://localhost:5173),
  separately supervised. Runs the C2A2-wiki repo's scripts/openstory-ui.sh in the
  foreground. Optional:
  the wiki feed does not need the UI, but this keeps the dashboard auto-running.
  Disable this agent if you only care about the data feed.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <key>Label</key>
  <string>com.tomloughran.openstory.ui</string>

  <key>ProgramArguments</key>
  <array>
    <string>/bin/bash</string>
    <string>/Users/tomloughran/Documents/Claude/Projects/RC Karpathy Wiki Project/scripts/openstory-ui.sh</string>
  </array>

  <key>RunAtLoad</key>
  <true/>
  <key>KeepAlive</key>
  <true/>

  <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
  <string>/Users/tomloughran/Documents/Non-Claude Projects/OpenStory/ui</string>

  <key>StandardOutPath</key>
  <string>/Users/tomloughran/Library/Logs/openstory-ui.log</string>
  <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
  <string>/Users/tomloughran/Library/Logs/openstory-ui-error.log</string>

  <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
  <dict>
    <key>HOME</key>
    <string>/Users/tomloughran</string>
    <key>PATH</key>
    <string>/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/opt/homebrew/bin:/Users/tomloughran/.cargo/bin:/Users/tomloughran/.local/bin</string>
  </dict>
</dict>
</plist>
